<p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 40pt; text-align: justify;">9.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<u>ASSIGNMENT OF REGISTRATION RIGHTS</u>.<u> </u></p>

